(https://github.com/elstongun/leviathan, version 0.1.0, commit eb045bb1892a8542db23a89f528fba67b3c7abbb), licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. It is a re-implementation in Python, modified for traceX (the changes are listed
in the module's header); no Leviathan source code is copied verbatim. Leviathan's NOTICE file reads:

    Leviathan
    Copyright 2026 The Leviathan Authors

    This product includes SQLite (public domain), compiled in via the
    rusqlite / libsqlite3-sys crates. See THIRD_PARTY.md for all dependencies
    and their licenses.

traceX uses SQLite (public domain) through Python's standard sqlite3 module.

